  "body": "If we can bear to swap out a temporary special case for a permanent one, it would be good to override `initial_device_display_name` from the initial request params with the one from the current request instead of ignoring it in https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/synapse/rest/client/v2_alpha/register.py#L283\r\n\r\nThis would let us set device display names correctly when registering.\r\n\r\nThis would probably be a thing that goes in the spec too.",
